<title>TURKEY: Twenty-five reported dead in Turkish road crash.</title>
<headline>Twenty-five reported dead in Turkish road crash.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty-five people were reported to have died in a road accident in eastern Turkey, Anatolian news agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>It said 18 people were believed to have been injured in the crash in the province of Erzincan. It provided no further details.</p>
